Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] P6.9 DW3_START_MODE_EVERY test hook

Patch 0124 makes DW3_START_MODE apply on the boot's newGame() only, so the
restart chord (patch 0046) reaches the real boot screen. The P6.9 replay
scenarios that test a second forced battle or field after a restart (a
fresh GAME, no title in between) need the old behaviour: with
DW3_START_MODE_EVERY set, every newGame() honours DW3_START_MODE again.
PC test hook only; nothing changes when the variable is unset.

--- a/src/engine/game/state.c
+++ b/src/engine/game/state.c
@@ -36,6 +36,14 @@
            to title, P6.27) must reach the title, not the forced mode again. */
         static int start_mode_used;
 
+        /* P6.9 test hook: DW3_START_MODE_EVERY=1 undoes the boot-only rule, so
+           a restart re-enters the forced mode (a second forced battle or
+           field on a reset GAME). */
+        const char *every = getenv("DW3_START_MODE_EVERY");
+
+        if (every != NULL && every[0] != '\0') {
+            start_mode_used = 0;
+        }
         if (start != NULL && start[0] != '\0' && !start_mode_used) {
             mode = strtol(start, &end, 0);
             if (end != start && mode > 0) {
